{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33782","headline":"公斋四咏 小松 · 皮日休","name":"公斋四咏 小松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"婆娑只三尺，移来白云径。\n亭亭向空意，已解凌辽敻。\n叶健似虯须，枝脆如鹤胫。\n清音犹未成，绀彩空不定。\n阴圆小芝盖，鳞涩修荷柄。\n先愁被鷃抢，预恐遭蜗病。\n结根幸得地，且免离离映。\n磥砢不难遇，在保晚成性。\n一日造明堂，爲君当毕命。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33782.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33782","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}